{title: We Three Kings of Orient Are}
{key: Am}
{time: 3/8}

[Am]We three kings of [E]Orient [Am]are;
[Am]Bearing gifts we [E]traverse a[Am]far,
[C]Field and [G/B]fountain, [Am]moor and [F]mountain,
[Dm]Following [E]yonder [Am]star.

{label: Chorus}
[G]O [C]star of wonder, [F]star of [C]night,
Star with royal [F]beauty [C]bright,
[Am]Westward [G]leading, [F]still pro[G]ceeding,
[C]Guide us to thy [F]perfect [C]light.

[Am]Born a King on [E]Bethlehem's [Am]plain,
[Am]Gold I bring to [E]crown Him a[Am]gain,
[C]King for[G/B]ever, [Am]ceasing [F]never,
[Dm]Over us [E]all to [Am]reign.

{label: Chorus}
[G]O [C]star of wonder, [F]star of [C]night,
Star with royal [F]beauty [C]bright,
[Am]Westward [G]leading, [F]still pro[G]ceeding,
[C]Guide us to thy [F]perfect [C]light.

[Am]Frankincense to [E]offer have [Am]I,
[Am]Incense owns a [E]Deity [Am]nigh;
[C]Prayer and [G/B]praising, [Am]all men [F]raising,
[Dm]Worship Him, [E]God on [Am]high.

{label: Chorus}
[G]O [C]star of wonder, [F]star of [C]night,
Star with royal [F]beauty [C]bright,
[Am]Westward [G]leading, [F]still pro[G]ceeding,
[C]Guide us to thy [F]perfect [C]light.

[Am]Myrrh is mine; its [E]bitter per[Am]fume,
[Am]Breathes a life of [E]gathering [Am]gloom;
[C]Sorr'wing, [G/B]sighing, [Am]bleeding, [F]dying,
[Dm]Sealed in the [E]stone-cold [Am]tomb.

{label: Chorus}
[G]O [C]star of wonder, [F]star of [C]night,
Star with royal [F]beauty [C]bright,
[Am]Westward [G]leading, [F]still pro[G]ceeding,
[C]Guide us to thy [F]perfect [C]light.

[Am]Glorious now be[E]hold Him a[Am]rise,
[Am]King and God and [E]sacri[Am]fice;
[C]Alle[G/B]luia, [Am]alle[F]luia!
[Dm]Earth to [E]heav'n re[Am]plies.

{label: Chorus}
[G]O [C]star of wonder, [F]star of [C]night,
Star with royal [F]beauty [C]bright,
[Am]Westward [G]leading, [F]still pro[G]ceeding,
[C]Guide us to thy [F]perfect [C]light.
